<title>GERMANY: Tietmeyer says welcomes dollar rise.</title>
<headline>Tietmeyer says welcomes dollar rise.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer on Thursday said he welcomed the dollar's recent improvement and said he would not mind if the currency improved still further.</p>
<p>&quot;I consider it a welcome development and I would not mind if it were to go a little further,&quot; Tietmeyer told a group of foreign journalists.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank President was referring to the dollar's recovery from recent lows against the mark in the past days.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
